# Windows launchers need CRLF: a `.bat` with Unix line endings fails in `cmd.exe` in
# obscure ways (labels and `goto` stop matching). Since the toolkit is developed on
# macOS and also run on Windows, without this git's normalization would undo the fix
# on every checkout.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Shell scripts need the opposite, even when cloned on Windows (Git Bash/WSL).
*.sh  text eol=lf
